### IRC Discussion Summaries

This is a place where summaries exist

- [https://gnusha.org/logs/summaries/](https://gnusha.org/logs/summaries/)
- finemateusz did a drive by [summary batch](https://gnusha.org/logs/summaries/finemateusz-hplusroadmap-daily-summaries.2026-03-04/
) which is the best quality so far as of 2026

### Semantic Search and Analysis

- kanzure has created [hpluslogs](https://github.com/kanzure/hpluslogs/), a tool to do RAG analysis and summarization on a particular topic: 
  - search query results, by source:
    - [hplusroadmap](https://diyhpl.us/~bryan/irc/chatgpt/hplusroadmap/) irc logs
    - [grg](https://diyhpl.us/~bryan/irc/chatgpt/grg/) mailing list
    - [orionsarm](https://diyhpl.us/~bryan/irc/chatgpt/orionsarm/) wiki
